<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Octicons 19.38.0 (MIT, info/LICENSE-octicons.txt), GitHub's icons, 16px variants on their own 16px grid
    (IconSize). Path data is the SVG source with explicit separators.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role; the comment above them names the octicon),
    plus the select and menu indicators, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground.

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) are theme file paths: Playnite's MenuHelpers.GetIcon loads a string resource as an
    image through ThemeFile. Images/Octicons holds the octicons rendered at 48px in fgColor-muted (fgColor-danger for
    exit and remove). Sidebar Library and Statistics get octicons through CustomControls/SidebarItem.xaml.
-->
